#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:33
msgid "源码安装"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:35
msgid "安装依赖"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:37
msgid "apt update\n"
"apt install zlib1g-dev clang-15 lld-15\n"
"apt install ccache # optional\n"
"update-alternatives --install /usr/bin/clang clang /usr/bin/clang-15 100\n"
"update-alternatives --install /usr/bin/clang++ clang++ /usr/bin/clang++-15 100\n"
"pip install ninja cmake wheel pybind11 # build-time dependencies\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:46
msgid "编译Triton-Ascend"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:48
msgid "git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend.git\n"
"cd triton-ascend\n"
"git checkout main\n"
"pip install -e .\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:55
msgid "自定义LLVM构建（可选）"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:57
msgid "如需自定义构建LLVM，可执行以下步骤编译Triton-Ascend。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:59
msgid "**代码准备**：通过`git checkout`检出指定版本的LLVM源码并应用补丁。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:61
msgid "git clone --no-checkout https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project.git\n"
"cd llvm-project\n"
"git checkout f6ded0be897e2878612dd903f7e8bb85448269e5\n"
"wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/main/third_party/ascend/patch/llvm_patch_f6ded0b.patch\n"
"git apply llvm_patch_f6ded0b.patch\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:69
msgid "**构建LLVM**：路径`/path/llvm-install`为用户规划的LLVM安装路径，需根据实际调整；路径`{PATH_TO}`为用户第一步检出LLVM源码的路径。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:71
msgid "export LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX=/path/llvm-install\n"
"cd {PATH_TO}/llvm-project\n"
"mkdir build\n"
"cd build\n"
"cmake ../llvm \\\n"
"    -G Ninja \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=/usr/bin/clang-15 \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=/usr/bin/clang++-15 \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_LINKER=/usr/bin/lld-15 \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_ENABLE_ASSERTIONS=ON \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_ENABLE_PROJECTS=\"mlir;llvm;lld\" \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_TARGETS_TO_BUILD=\"host;NVPTX;AMDGPU\" \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_ENABLE_LLD=ON \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX}\n"
"ninja install\n"
"\n"
"cp  {PATH_TO}/llvm-project/build/bin/FileCheck ${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX}/bin/FileCheck\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:92
msgid "**编译Triton-Ascend**：通过配置LLVM路径定位依赖库，启用ccache加速编译，并关闭proton和单元测试来减少构建开销。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:94
msgid "git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend.git\n"
"cd triton-ascend\n"
"LLVM_SYSPATH=${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX} \\\n"
"TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CCACHE=true \\\n"
"TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CLANG_LLD=true \\\n"
"TRITON_BUILD_PROTON=OFF \\\n"
"TRITON_WHEEL_NAME=\"triton-ascend\" \\\n"
"TRITON_APPEND_CMAKE_ARGS=\"-DTRITON_BUILD_UT=OFF\" \\\n"
"python3 setup.py install\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:106
msgid "**源码编译参数说明表**"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "参数（环境变量）"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "默认值"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`LLVM_SYSPATH`"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "None"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "指定本地已编译好的 LLVM 安装路径。设置后不再下载 LLVM 预编译包，离线构建时必填，即上文构建 LLVM 步骤中的 `${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX}`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CLANG_LLD`"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "true"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "使用 clang/clang++ 作为编译器、lld 作为链接器，需提前安装 clang>=15、lld>=15。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CCACHE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "启用 ccache 缓存编译结果，加速重复构建，需提前安装 ccache。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_PROTON`"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "OFF"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "是否构建 Proton 性能分析器（profiler）。需要时设为 `ON`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_TD`"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "是否构建 TD（Triton-distributed-ascend）相关组件，默认关闭。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_NPUIR`"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "是否在安装过程中同步编译 AscendNPU-IR。设为 `ON` 时会触发 `build_npuir.py` 流程。<br> AscendNPU-IR编译依赖CANN,需source {home}/Ascend/cann/set_env.sh且可用磁盘大于30G。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:115
msgid "<br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_WHEEL_NAME`"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "triton_ascend"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "生成的 wheel 包名称，一般无需修改。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_APPEND_CMAKE_ARGS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "追加透传给 CMake 的参数，多个参数用空格分隔。例如追加 `-DTRITON_BUILD_UT=ON` 可开启单元测试构建。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_OFFLINE_BUILD`"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "设为 `ON` 后禁止构建过程中访问网络下载依赖（会自动关闭需联网拉取 googletest 的单元测试构建），用于离线环境。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`MAX_JOBS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "2 × CPU core"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "编译并行任务数。内存紧张时可调小，例如 `export MAX_JOBS=8`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_PARALLEL_LINK_JOBS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "并行链接任务数。链接阶段占用内存较大，内存不足时可设为 `1`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`IS_MANYLINUX`"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "设为 `ON` 后构建生成的 wheel 包为 manylinux 兼容格式，用于在不同 Linux 发行版上安装。"
msgstr ""

