#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:346
msgid "安装常见问题"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:348
msgid "**问题一：安装TorchNPU时出现报错“ERROR: No matching distribution found for torch==2.7.1+cpu”**"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:350
#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:360
#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:377
msgid "**解决措施**"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:352
msgid "可以尝试手动安装torch后再安装TorchNPU："
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:354
msgid "pip install torch==2.7.1+cpu --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:358
msgid "**问题二：编译安装Triton-Ascend时，如果GCC < 9.4.0，可能报错“ld.lld: error: unable to find library -lstdc++fs”**"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:362
msgid "一般是链接器无法找到stdc++fs库引起的报错。该库用于支持GCC 9之前版本的文件系统特性。此时需要手动把CMake文件中以下相关代码片段的注释打开。 文件路径：triton-ascend/CMakeLists.txt"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:365
msgid "if (NOT WIN32 AND NOT APPLE)\n"
"link_libraries(stdc++fs)\n"
"endif()\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:371
msgid "**问题三：执行算子时报错“ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'triton._C.libtriton.ascend'; 'triton._C.libtriton' is not a package”**"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:373
msgid "**根因分析**"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:375
msgid "triton-ascend目录被triton覆盖，导致triton-ascend功能受损。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:379
msgid "卸载已损坏的triton-ascend，重新安装即可。以3.2.1版本为例，可执行如下命令修复："
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:381
msgid "pip uninstall triton-ascend triton\n"
"pip install triton-ascend==3.2.1 --extra-index-url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:386
msgid "**问题四：Triton-Ascend 3.2.1版本为何新增依赖triton？**"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:388
msgid "答复：Triton-Ascend是基于Triton进行的二次开发，与Triton安装目录同名。若用户安装Triton-Ascend之后，再次安装Triton或依赖Triton的三方件，会覆盖Triton目录，导致Triton-Ascend功能受损。 因此通过增加Triton依赖，当Triton被覆盖安装时会有如下提醒。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:391
msgid "ERROR: pip's dependency resolver does not currently take into account all the packages that are installed. This behaviour is the source of the following dependency conflicts.\n"
"triton-ascend 3.2.1 requires triton==3.5.0, but you have triton 3.5.1 which is incompatible.\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:396
msgid "若用户遇到且想恢复Triton-Ascend功能，可根据问题三的解决措施进行命令修复。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:398
msgid "**问题五：Triton-Ascend 3.2.1版本依赖的Triton版本为何不一致？**"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:400
msgid "答复：x86与Arm使用不同版本的社区Triton安装包，是因为社区从Triton 3.2版本开始提供x86安装包，而Arm安装包是从Triton 3.5版本开始提供的。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:402
msgid "**问题六：如何确认芯片类型？**"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:404
msgid "可以使用npu-smi命令查看系统上的NPU型号。例如，在npu-smi info命令的输出中，“910B4”对应芯片类型A2（昇腾910b系列）："
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/installation_guide.md:406
msgid "root@localhost:/# npu-smi  info\n"
"+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n"
"| npu-smi 26.0.rc1                            Version: 26.0.rc1                                                    |\n"
"+---------------------------+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------+\n"
"| NPU   Name                | Health        | Power(W)             Temp(C)                 Hugepages-Usage(page)   |\n"
"| Chip                      | Bus-Id        | AICore(%)            Memory-Usage(MB)        HBM-Usage(MB)           |\n"
"+===========================+===============+======================================================================+\n"
"| 0     910B4               | OK            | 82.6                 32                      0    / 0                |\n"
"| 0                         | 0000:C1:00.0  | 0                    0    / 0                2871 / 32768            |\n"
"+===========================+===============+======================================================================+\n"
"+---------------------------+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------+\n"
"| NPU     Chip              | Process id    | Process name       | Process memory(MB)    | Process id in container |\n"
"+===========================+===============+======================================================================+\n"
"| No running processes found in NPU 0                                                                              |\n"
""
msgstr ""
